  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "step1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Gate 1: Manifest & Versioning\n- Lowercase `id` without `obsidian`\n- `version` & `minAppVersion` strict `X.Y.Z`\n- `versions.json` parity\n- Description <= 250 chars with period",
      "color": "4",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 210
    },
    {
      "id": "step2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Gate 2: Lifecycle & Memory\n- Zero `detachLeavesOfType` in `onunload()`\n- `this.register*` for events/DOM/intervals\n- Deferred view safe (`instanceof` after reveal)\n- Unmount React/Svelte & dispose WebGL in `onClose()`",
      "color": "5",
      "x": 380,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 210
    },
    {
      "id": "step3",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Gate 3: Security, Mobile & Sync\n- Zero `innerHTML` / `outerHTML`\n- Zero `node:*` / `electron` if `isDesktopOnly: false`\n- `requestUrl` for cross-origin HTTP\n- Keep `data.json` lean for Obsidian Sync",
      "color": "1",
      "x": 780,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 210
    },
    {
